  "body": "XHTML does not exists anymore as a standalone technology.\r\nBut HTML allow XML syntax to continue to support XHTML formated pages (https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/xhtml.html).\r\nThis proposition concerns only (for now, maybe forever) the XML synatx section.\r\nAccept attaching shadow dom on these elements `<prefix:xml_element />` will allow developpers to easily  implements existing technologies (like XForms) and can be a starting point to propose an alternative to the Custom Element API (to avoid the knowledge fragmentation problems)",
